graph TD
    Start([User Question]) --> A[Entity Extraction Node]
    A --> B[Query Generator Node]
    B --> C[Query Checker Node]
    C -->|Satisfied| D[Final Query & Results]
    C -->|Regenerate| B

    subgraph "Entity Extraction"
        A1[Analyze Question] --> A2[Identify Entities/Properties]
        A2 --> A3[Search Wikidata API]
        A3 --> A4[Retrieve Entity/Property IDs]
    end

    subgraph "Query Generation"
        B1[Construct SPARQL] --> B2[Add Necessary Prefixes]
        B2 --> B3[Format Query]
    end

    subgraph "Query Checking"
        C1[Execute Query] --> C2[Analyze Results]
        C2 --> C3[Verify Relevance]
        C3 --> C4[Decision: Satisfied or Regenerate]
    end
